5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura. I love mysteries and pranks! Let's have fun finding the werewolf together!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hi, I'm Minato. I'm a little nervous, but I want to help. Let's be kind to each other while we figure this out.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm Takumi. I'm not scared of this game. Let's find the wolf and protect our friends.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hey! I'm Mio! I'm super excited to be here. Let's all stay positive and figure this out together!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,I am Shion. I observe quietly. Let us see who truly understands the game before we act.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, that sounds a bit serious! I think we should all just be friends and have fun, right?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,I agree with Sakura. Being kind is important. I hope we can all trust each other and find the truth together.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need to be friends to win. I will watch everyone closely. If you hide something, I will find it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,I like Takumi's confidence! But let's not be too harsh. I think we should all share our thoughts openly to build trust.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"I appreciate the enthusiasm. However, trust is earned through logic, not just words. I will remain silent and watch your actions closely.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, you're so intense! I just want to make sure everyone feels safe. Let's keep the vibes friendly, okay?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,"I think Takumi is right to be careful. But I also hope we can stay gentle. I am just a little boy, so please be nice to me.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, I will protect you. But I won't let my guard down. The wolf is hiding among us, and I will find them.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"I love the teamwork! @Minato, don't worry, we've got your back. Let's keep the energy up and stay alert for any weird behavior!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Minato, your vulnerability is noted. The wolf will exploit weakness. I will not offer comfort, only cold observation.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight everyone! I hope we all sleep well and wake up ready to solve this mystery. See you in the morning!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minato,,"Goodnight, everyone. I hope we all have peaceful dreams. I will try to stay calm and listen carefully tomorrow.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Goodnight. I will be watching. The wolf cannot hide from me forever.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Mio,,Goodnight! I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow. Let's all stay sharp and have a great night!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Goodnight. I will analyze your words. Sleep well, or don't. The truth will emerge regardless of your comfort.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
