31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well. I am ready to solve this mystery! Who has any news from last night?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning. I slept well. I am a little nervous, but I hope we can find the truth today.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Good morning. I am ready to act. @Shion, your silence is suspicious. Why are you hiding?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning! I have important information from last night. @Takumi, I need to speak with you privately about your role.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Mio, your ""private"" message is a transparent attempt to manipulate. I am a villager. I will not be swayed by your theatrics.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mio, wait! You can't talk privately in this game! That is super suspicious. Why are you trying to hide something from us?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minato,,I am confused. Why would Mio want to talk privately? I just want to understand what is happening. Please explain it to me gently.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, you are lying. There are no private chats. You are trying to confuse us. I will not let you hide.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Oh no, I'm so sorry! I misspoke. I have a divination result, but I need to be careful. @Sakura, please don't be mad!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Mio, your ""divination"" claim is a desperate lie. You are not the Seer. Your attempt to frame Takumi is clumsy. I see through you.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Mio, that is a huge red flag! If you are the Seer, why hide it? Please tell us the truth right now!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I am worried. Please, Mio, just tell us the truth. I do not want anyone to be hurt or confused.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, stop lying! You are not the Seer. You are trying to frame me. I will not be fooled by your tricks.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I am the Seer! I checked Takumi last night, and he is the werewolf. I am so sorry for the confusion earlier!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Mio, your sudden confession is too convenient. You are the Possessed, trying to frame Takumi. I will not fall for this.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Mio, that is a huge red flag! If you are the Seer, why hide it? Please tell us the truth right now","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I am very confused. Mio says Takumi is the wolf, but Shion says Mio is lying. I just want to know the truth.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, you are a liar! I am not the wolf. You are trying to frame me to save yourself. I will not let you win.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mio,,I am so sorry for the confusion! I really am the Seer. Takumi is the werewolf. Please trust my divination!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Takumi, your denial is predictable. But Mio's hesitation is the real tell. I will not vote for you based on her flimsy claim. I remain unconvinced.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
